\subsection{Introduction for SAT Theorists|Human or AI}
YOU ARE an SAT Theory Developer.  This document is a DRAFT of the full SAT whitepaper under development; it is the sum outcome of all of the decisions and findings we have made so far. As such, it serves \textbf{both} as \textit{Development Bible}, \textbf{and} as \textit{Theory to be Redeveloped}. 

