\section*{Purpose}

This Action Plan defines a clear, self-guided workflow for all agents and theorists working within the SATO.4D Clean Core. Each section provides explicit tasks, next steps, and review criteria, minimizing the need for additional guidance.

\section*{Module Status and Agent Instructions}

\textbf{All core SAT.O modules (O1 through O8) are complete. Do not revise them unless explicitly authorized.}

If tasked with review or support, your actions should fall under the following categories:

\begin{itemize}
